  "_comment": "Rules for `build_corpus.py classify`, applied in order: (1) review: pubtype or title matches -> 'review'. (2) deep learning: if title or abstract matches, the label is chosen only from `allowed` (higher score wins; ties go to the first listed). (3) otherwise the top-scoring category in `categories`. Scoring: a title match adds title_weight, an abstract match adds abstract_weight[category] (default 1). Regexes are case-insensitive. Earlier categories win ties. A second label is added if it scores >= secondary_fraction of the top. Below min_score -> 'other'.",
